              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, javelins and Saxon buckler. May have light armour (+3), throwing spears (+4), horse (+8). One Thegn may be upgraded to Army Standard Bearer (+15). No Character Advantages. (The Age of Arthur p.49)</characteristic>
