                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Javelins, hand weapon and Saxon buckler. May have throwing spears (+1). Light Infantry, Fierce. Warband rules 1 and 2 (Fierce). (The Age of Arthur p.50)</characteristic>
