  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="5c0d-5b41-f4f6-dd6e" name="Saxons: The Sea Raiders (Age of Arthur) - List Notes" publicationId="28aa-c13e-b61d-4f3e" hidden="false">
      <description>THE SAXONS: THE SEA RAIDERS (The Age of Arthur, pp.44-51). Units of Gedriht, Duguth and Geoguth may have a Leader (+5), Musician (+5) and Standard (+5).

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Saxons: The Sea Raiders]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Common Warriors: at least 50%
  Uncommon Warriors: up to 10%
  THE SEA RAIDERS. Characters up to 33% (no Cyning, Army Standard or Christian Priest; the army must be led by an Atheling upgraded to Army General). Common warriors at least 50% (Gedriht and Geoguth; no more than 33% of the points on Gedriht). Uncommon up to 10% (Skirmishers). Allies up to 25% from one list: Franks (Early Merovingian; Franci led by 0-1 Dux or Antrustio) or the Picts (Early Southern Pictish Kingdoms; Warriors led by Mormaer or Champion). More than one unit of Gedriht may be fielded; each Gedriht unit must be led by an Atheling or Thegn (not enforced).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
